<title>JAPAN: Citizen Elec plans share split.</title>
<headline>Citizen Elec plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizen Electronics Co Ltd said on Wednesday it planned a 1.3-for-1 share split on May 20, for shareholders as of March 31.</p>
